              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malaika owa mukaaga yaseesa ebiri omu kibindi kye ha kisaaru ekikooto Efuraate. Amaizi gaakyo gaayomera kimu, nukwo hateekanizibwe omuhanda abakama abarukuruga Burugaizooba ogu basobora kurabamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi narora emyoyo emibi esatu, erukusisana ebikere, neeruga omu kanwa k'ekijoka, omu kanwa k'ekinyamaiswa, n'omu kanwa k'omurangi ow'ebisuba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Egi niyo myoyo ya Sitaani enyakukora ebihuniriza, enyakugenda omu bakama ab'ensi zoona kubasorooza baije ha bulemu ha kiro kikuru ekya Ruhanga ow'obusobozi bwona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
