            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orubuga orukuru rwayahukanizibwa omu bicweka bisatu, n'embuga enkuru ez'amahanga zaagwa, zaahwerekerra, baitu Ruhanga ateebwe Bbabbulooni, yaijuka orubuga oruranganwa kurunywisa ekikopo kyona ekiijwire empotole ey'ekiniga kye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
